      "open_options_invalid",
      `REA_KUNA_CACHE_MAX_BYTES must be a decimal byte count of at least ${String(MIN_CACHE_MAX_BYTES)}; received ${String(rawMaxBytes)}.`,
      "REA_KUNA_CACHE_MAX_BYTES",
